## 11. How this avoids the previous bug

Previously:
- browser -> Web Chat -> Direct Line -> Bot Service -> Foundry Channel

That path inserted another auth/interaction layer, which caused:
- a login card
- extra user friction
- a mismatch between portal auth and bot-channel auth

Now:
- browser -> APIM -> function -> Foundry

This path avoids the bot channel altogether on the client side, so the user stays in the portal experience and the browser never tries to authenticate directly to Foundry.

