## 13. Summary

The full end-to-end trace is:

- The portal chat widget is the user-facing shell.
- The browser sends the question to APIM.
- APIM enforces API-level guardrails.
- The Azure Function BFF validates, maps session state, and acquires credentials.
- The Function calls the Foundry TicketDeflection application endpoint.
- Foundry returns the answer.
- The Function cleans it and returns it to the browser through APIM.

This is the cleanest way to preserve portal UX, keep credentials hidden, and avoid the login-card issue caused by the Bot Service channel path.

